flowchart TB
  subgraph Browser["Browser · React + Vite"]
    P[Passenger pages<br/>search · seats · checkout · ticket]
    C[Operations console<br/>dashboard · manifest · reports]
  end
  subgraph API["Node.js · Express modular monolith"]
    MW[Middleware<br/>request id · session · RBAC · error shape]
    R[routes.ts<br/>HTTP + Zod validation]
    subgraph S[Services · business rules]
      INV[inventory<br/>search · seat map · holds]
      BK[bookings<br/>confirm · cancel · refunds]
      NET[network<br/>routes · schedules · trips]
      FL[fleet<br/>operators · buses · layouts · policy]
      REP[reports<br/>manifest · occupancy · reconciliation]
      AU[audit]
    end
    D[domain/<br/>pure rules: pricing · cancellation tiers<br/>state machines · PNR · layout generator]
    OA[OpenAPI from the same Zod schemas<br/>/api/docs]
  end
  DB[(PostgreSQL 16<br/>constraints · exclusion · triggers)]
  P & C -->|JSON over /api/v1, httpOnly cookie| MW --> R --> S
  S --> D
  S -->|one transaction per action| DB
  R -.-> OA
